---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { docsNav } from '../../site';
---
<Base title="MacPeek Documentation: Install, Use, Manage Utilities, Troubleshoot" description="Documentation for MacPeek: install the app, use the launcher, manage utilities, PortPeek guides, permissions, privacy, security and troubleshooting.">
  <div class="wrap narrow article">
    <h1>MacPeek documentation</h1>
    <p class="lede">Everything you need to install MacPeek, choose your utilities and use them safely.</p>
    <ul>{docsNav.map((l) => <li><a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a></li>)}</ul>
    <p>Looking for a specific Mac problem? See the <a href="/blog/">guides</a> or browse all <a href="/utilities/">utilities</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
